{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o013d","title":"张辽等破吕范病卒江都张虎嗣","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o013d-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"张辽等破吕范病卒江都张虎嗣","evidence":["zhangle-e-o013d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0178","role":"破军而卒","evidence":["zhangle-e-o013d-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0157","role":"被破","evidence":["zhangle-e-o013d-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"悼惜","evidence":["zhangle-e-o013d-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0011","role":"嗣爵","evidence":["zhangle-e-o013d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"黄初二年以后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o013d-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o013d-q","source_order":[17,42,"O013d"],"order":3500},{"id":"zhangle-e-o014b","title":"张虎为偏将军卒张统嗣","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o014b-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"张虎为偏将军卒张统嗣","evidence":["zhangle-e-o014b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhangle-p0011","role":"任官而卒","evidence":["zhangle-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0012","role":"嗣爵","evidence":["zhangle-e-o014b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"张虎任官至卒","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o014b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o014b-q","source_order":[17,43,"O014b"],"order":3502}],"persons":[{"id":"zhangle-p0011","name":"张虎","evidence":["zhangle-q-o013"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangle-m-o013-zhangle-p0011","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o013"]},{"id":"zhangle-m-o014-zhangle-p0011","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o014"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o013d-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-96070d5724473c2e0ea5","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，辽与诸将破权将吕范。辽病笃，遂薨于江都〖9〗。帝为流涕，谥曰刚侯。子虎嗣。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":41,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":214,"end":254,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o014b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-64eb10ae500c10e54906","layer":"original","quote":"虎为偏将军，薨。子统嗣。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":86,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o013","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-96070d5724473c2e0ea5","layer":"original","quote":"黄初二年，辽朝洛阳宫。文帝引辽会建始殿，亲问破吴意状〖4〗。帝叹息，顾左右曰：“此亦古之召虎也〖5〗！”为起第舍，又特为辽母作殿；以辽所从破吴军应募步卒，皆为虎贲〖6〗。孙权复称藩，辽还屯雍丘，得疾。帝遣侍中刘晔将太医视疾〖7〗，虎贲问消息，道路相属。疾未瘳，帝迎辽就行在所。车驾亲临，执其手；赐以御衣，太官日送御食。疾小差〖8〗，还屯。孙权复叛，帝遣辽，乘舟与曹休至海陵，临江。权甚惮焉，敕诸将：“张辽虽病，不可当也。慎之！”是岁，辽与诸将破权将吕范。辽病笃，遂薨于江都〖9〗。帝为流涕，谥曰刚侯。子虎嗣。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":41,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":254,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o014","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-64eb10ae500c10e54906","layer":"original","quote":"六年〖10〗，帝追念辽、典在合肥之功，诏曰：“合肥之役，辽、典以步卒八百，破贼十万；自古用兵，未之有也！使贼至今夺气，可谓国之爪牙矣。其分辽、典邑各百户，赐一子爵关内侯。”虎为偏将军，薨。子统嗣。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
